{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.KnotTheory","lean:module:QOU.KnotTheory.JonesPolynomial","lean:module:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.MetallicHierarchy","lean:module:QOU.MassDerivation","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Order.Interval.Set.Basic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.DeltaLambdaPiecewise.piecewise_closure_exists","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.DeltaLambdaPiecewise.piecewise_closure_exists","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/MetallicPiecewise.lean#L134-L134","doc":"There exist distinct closed-form expressions on `(1, φ)` vs\n`(φ, δ_silver)` that each match the deuteron Δ_λ to within\nWenzl-positivity bounds on their respective intervals. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.DeltaLambdaPiecewise.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.DeltaLambdaPiecewise.mk","kind":"ctor","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/MetallicPiecewise.lean#L130-L130","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.DeltaLambdaPiecewise","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.DeltaLambdaPiecewise","kind":"class","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/MetallicPiecewise.lean#L112-L134","doc":"Conjectural witness for (M3).\n\n**Fixed 2026-09-12 (`prop-universe-field`).** The field was typed bare\n`: Prop` — the *universe* of propositions, not a proposition — so an instance\nsupplied a proposition rather than a proof of one and `instance := ⟨True⟩`\ndischarged the class. A carrier in that state cannot serve as a §3b\nconjectural witness either: it asserts nothing *even as a conjecture*. The\nstatement is now a **parameter**, so assuming the conjecture costs a proof of\nit rather than costing nothing.\n\nNote the contrast with `MetallicSDPJumps` directly above, whose fields are\ngenuine propositions (`blindSDPCount (metallic n - ε) ≠ blindSDPCount (metallic\nn + ε)`, `count_at_substrate : … = 252`) — the defect was local to this\ncarrier, not a habit of the file.\n\nProved for the shape in\n`QOU.ProofHygiene.SelfAssumingContexts.propUniverse_inhabited`. The conjecture\nis untouched and still open; no instance is supplied. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.CatalogBlindSDPCount.count_at_substrate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.CatalogBlindSDPCount.count_at_substrate","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/MetallicPiecewise.lean#L103-L103","doc":"At the substrate value `q₀ ≈ 1.1097`\n(`QOU.MassDerivation.substrate_q`), the count equals 252. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.CatalogBlindSDPCount.jumps_at_metallic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.CatalogBlindSDPCount.jumps_at_metallic","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/MetallicPiecewise.lean#L99-L99","doc":"`blindSDPCount` jumps at every metallic ratio. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.CatalogBlindSDPCount.piecewise_constant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.CatalogBlindSDPCount.piecewise_constant","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/MetallicPiecewise.lean#L95-L95","doc":"`blindSDPCount` is constant on each open metallic interval. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.CatalogBlindSDPCount.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.CatalogBlindSDPCount.mk","kind":"ctor","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/MetallicPiecewise.lean#L93-L93","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.CatalogBlindSDPCount","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.CatalogBlindSDPCount","kind":"class","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/MetallicPiecewise.lean#L92-L103","doc":"Conjectural witness for (M2). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.blindSDPCount","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.blindSDPCount","kind":"opaque","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/MetallicPiecewise.lean#L87-L90","doc":"Catalog-blind SDP-feasibility count, declared opaque pending the\nparametric-SDP enumeration infrastructure (sib. infra to\n`nucleus_real_sdp.py` but not pinned to a fixed character witness). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.HigherStrandCharacterBifurcation.exists_witness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.HigherStrandCharacterBifurcation.exists_witness","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/MetallicPiecewise.lean#L73-L73","doc":"There exists a strand count, partition, and braid word whose\nq-character has a root at every metallic ratio. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.HigherStrandCharacterBifurcation.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.HigherStrandCharacterBifurcation.mk","kind":"ctor","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/MetallicPiecewise.lean#L70-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.HigherStrandCharacterBifurcation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.MetallicPiecewise.HigherStrandCharacterBifurcation","kind":"class","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/MetallicPiecewise.lean#L69-L73","doc":"Conjectural witness for (M1). ","signatureChunk":0}]}